    "body": "**Description:**\r\n\"U\" parameter seems not recognized when executing the forget-me.sh script in windows env.\r\n\r\n**Affected Product Version**:\r\nEI 6.1.1 update 23\r\n\r\n**OS, DB, other environment details and versions**:\r\nWindows 2012 R2\r\nJDK 1.8\r\nDB - h2\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce**:\r\n1. Start the EI server\r\n2. Create a simple proxy that logs the username coming in the headers.\r\n3. Invoke the proxy\r\n4. Configure forget-me.sh script to replace the log file information (define the pattern in ei-pattern)\r\n5. Execute the forget-me.sh script\r\n\r\n**Observations**\r\nFailed to execute the script, as observed the \"U\" parameter is not recognized.\r\n![sample](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14962228/37089693-782a4df0-2227-11e8-96b8-74931962feab.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
